Our main product is the Omnipod System, which we introduced to the market in 2005. We expect to continue to derive a significant portion of
our revenue from the sale of this product. Accordingly, our ability to generate revenue is highly reliant on our ability to market and sell the devices
that comprise the Omnipod System. Our sales of the Omnipod System may be negatively impacted by many factors, including:
